\title{GOFER: GOFER: Gene Ontology Functional Enrichment in R}
\description{
Tests Gene Ontology categories for enrichment in ranked gene scores from differential expression analyses (for example DESeq2 results) and in WGCNA co-expression modules. Methods are the Mann-Whitney U test on gene ranks, Fisher's exact test on a significant gene set, and average precision with a resampled null and a generalized Pareto tail. Annotations are propagated through the current GO release (is_a and part_of), and every run writes its result tables and a settings file to an output directory.
